flowchart TD
  subgraph ING[Offline ingestion]
    A[Knowledge base: MD / CSV / PDF / DOCX / TXT] --> B[LangChain loaders + metadata]
    B --> C[Deduplicate + recursive chunking]
    C --> D[OpenAI Embeddings]
    D --> E[(Persistent Chroma index)]
  end
  subgraph Q[Online query]
    U[Streamlit user] --> H[Session history]
    H --> R[Query condensation]
    R --> V[Chroma similarity retriever + relevance gate]
    E --> V
    V --> P[Grounded LangChain prompt]
    P --> L[ChatOpenAI structured output]
    L --> S[Pydantic validation + citation validation]
    S --> O[Answer / partial answer / refusal]
  end
